/*
      ================================================================
      ESP32 AI ASSISTANT - U8G2 FIRMWARE (SH1106 / SSD1306)
      Changes in this version:
        - Top status bar made shorter (8px instead of 12px)
        - Prompt box is now dynamic height: starts as a single thin
          line and grows (up to 3 lines) as you type more text
        - AI answers are longer (max_tokens 350 -> 900)
        - Answer scrolling is now smooth (pixel-level animated
          scroll instead of jumping 3 lines at a time), with a
          small scrollbar on the right edge
      ================================================================
      Hardware Pin Mapping:
        Display Pin   ->  ESP32 GPIO
        -----------       ----------
        GND           ->  GND
        VCC           ->  3.3V (ya 5V/VIN)
        SCK (CLK)     ->  GPIO 18
        SDA (MOSI)    ->  GPIO 23
        RES (Reset)   ->  GPIO 4
        DC  (Data/Cmd)->  GPIO 2
        CS  (Chip Sel)->  GPIO 5

      Keyboard Pins:
        Rows (3)      ->  GPIO 14, 13, 12
        Cols (10)     ->  GPIO 19, 15, 17, 16, 22, 21, 32, 33, 25, 27
        Space switch  ->  GPIO 34 (external 10k pull-up to 3.3V)
      ================================================================
*/

